## ============================================
## DarkX - perulangan (~~)
## ============================================

::: i === 1 ;;
~~ ((i <=? 5)) {{
    >>> "Hitungan:" ,, i ;;
    i === i +++ 1 ;;
}}

## jumlahkan 1..10
::: total === 0 ;;
::: n === 1 ;;
~~ ((n <=? 10)) {{
    total === total +++ n ;;
    n === n +++ 1 ;;
}}
>>> "Total 1..10 ===" ,, total ;;
